\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ky album \u00ebsht\u00eb realizuar me q\u00ebllim dokumentimin, ruajtjen dhe promovimin e vlerave t\u00eb \u00e7muara kulturore, etnografike dhe historike t\u00eb komunitetit maqedonas n\u00eb zon\u00ebn e Pustecit. P\u00ebrmes k\u00ebtij albumi, q\u00eb u realizua n\u00eb kuad\u00ebr t\u00eb projektit &#8220;Minoriteti maqedonas n\u00eb Pustec, trash\u00ebgimi brez pas brezi&#8221; synohet t\u00eb nd\u00ebrtohet nj\u00eb ur\u00eb komunikimi midis t\u00eb kaluar\u00ebs dhe t\u00eb ardhmes, duke mbledhur n\u00eb nj\u00eb botim t\u00eb vet\u00ebm d\u00ebshmit\u00eb e gjalla t\u00eb nj\u00eb kulture unike.<br>Ky botim dhe digjitalizimi i materialeve arkivore u mund\u00ebsua me mb\u00ebshtetjen financiare t\u00eb Agjencis\u00eb p\u00ebr Mb\u00ebshtetjen e Shoq\u00ebris\u00eb Civile (AMSHC).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div data-wp-interactive=\"core\/file\" class=\"wp-block-file\"><object data-wp-bind--hidden=\"!state.hasPdfPreview\" hidden class=\"wp-block-file__embed\" data=\"https:\/\/qendrakazus.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Katalogu-mail-6.pdf\" type=\"application\/pdf\" style=\"width:100%;height:600px\" aria-label=\"Embed of Katalogu - mail.\"><\/object><a id=\"wp-block-file--media-5f29ac20-33af-4ecb-9d7b-7bc0afda3aa8\" href=\"https:\/\/qendrakazus.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Katalogu-mail-6.pdf\">Katalogu &#8211; mail<\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/qendrakazus.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/Katalogu-mail-6.pdf\" class=\"wp-block-file__button wp-element-button\" download aria-describedby=\"wp-block-file--media-5f29ac20-33af-4ecb-9d7b-7bc0afda3aa8\">Download<\/a><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ky album \u00ebsht\u00eb realizuar me q\u00ebllim dokumentimin, ruajtjen dhe promovimin e vlerave t\u00eb \u00e7muara kulturore, etnografike dhe historike t\u00eb komunitetit [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":153,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","form